hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2918","Narrated to us Muhammad bin Yahya, who said: Narrated to us Abu Nu'aym, who said: Narrated to us Zuhayr. In another narration: Narrated to us Muhammad bin al-'Ala' bin Kurayb, who said: Narrated to us Sinan bin Muzahir, from Zuhayr, from Abu al-Zubayr, from Jabir (RA), who said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \"Do not slaughter (for sacrifice) except a musinnah"
